title: "Sharp termination boundary for the Carlet–Feukoua–Sălăgean construction at r = n−3"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "Every legal prefix in Algorithm 1 of Carlet, Feukoua and Sălăgean extends for r = n−3 and n at least nine, answering the scenario raised in Remark 2. The proof is combinatorial. At n = 8, a Fano-plane prefix blocks every final candidate, showing the threshold is sharp."
